  "description": "Kang Chayoung and Lee Saehan, once middle school classmates, cross paths again in college. After a drunken night at the freshman welcome party, they slip into a friends-with-benefits arrangement—or something close to it. But their connection is hard to define, hovering somewhere between lust and something deeper.\n\n*\"You’re driving me crazy. I don’t even know what I’m doing anymore because of you.\"*  \n*\"Then be crazy enough to be gentle with me, okay?\"*\n\nA relationship that began crooked from the start. Which one of them will confess their true feelings first?\n\n**Original Novel:**  \n[Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/Mytype), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/novel/E000078271)\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/TasteShoot), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/tasteshoot), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000065689), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=11671121)",
